SCOPE. The MIT terms above cover the CODE in this repository only.

The datasets are NOT redistributed here and are NOT covered by this licence.
`data/` is gitignored; `scripts/download_data.py` fetches each corpus from its
original host and `data/PROVENANCE.md` records the slug, date and size of every
download. Each dataset carries its own terms, all of them academic-use:

  5G-NIDD       Samarakoon et al., IEEE DataPort  -- academic use
  CICIoT2023    Canadian Institute for Cybersecurity -- academic use
  CICIoMT2024   Canadian Institute for Cybersecurity -- academic use
  CICIoV2024    Canadian Institute for Cybersecurity -- academic use (EXCLUDED from
                all results; see docs/RESULTS_MATRIX.md for why)

Read and accept those terms with the provider before running anything that
downloads them. The scaffolded model artifacts under `artifacts/models/` are
derived from these datasets and inherit their restrictions.
